desc: Greet each name using a macro
category: macro
par: 19
hint1: Record the edit for one line, then replay it
hint2: qa records to register a; @a replays; a count replays multiple times
solution: qaIHello, <Esc>A!<Esc>jq2@a
note: qa records macro 'a': I inserts 'Hello, ' at line start, <Esc>; A appends '!',
note: <Esc>; j moves to the next line; q stops. 2@a replays it on the last two lines.
--- START ---
Alice
Bob
Carol
--- GOAL ---
Hello, Alice!
Hello, Bob!
Hello, Carol!
--- END ---
